abetes Mellitus)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e1e4e8; padding:7px 10px; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e1e4e8; padding:7px 10px; text-align:left;\">Urine Sugar</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e1e4e8; padding:7px 10px; text-align:center;\">Nil</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e1e4e8; padding:7px 10px; text-align:center;\">-</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e1e4e8; padding:7px 10px; text-align:left;\">Nil</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e1e4e8; padding:7px 10px; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div style=\"margin-top:12px; padding:8px 12px; background:#fafbfc; border-left:3px solid #007bff; font-size:12px; color:#555;\"><strong>Note:</strong> Specimen: Plasma. Diagnosis of diabetes requires confirmation with Fasting Plasma Glucose or HbA1c.</div>\n</div>', '100001', '98', '1');

